{"strongs": "H6293", "word": "פָּגַע", "translit": "pa.ga", "root": "פגל", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "meet, encounter, reach", "definition": "פָּגַע verb meet, encounter, reach (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic פְּגַע , ; possibly akin to Arabic , happen to, light upon ; is pain, afflict ); — Qal Perfect 3 masculine singular ׳ פ 1Kgs 2:32 +, suffix וּפְגָעוֺ consecutive Amos 5:19 , etc.; Imperfect 3 masculine singular וַיִּפְגַּע Gen 28:11 +; 1 plural נְפְגַּע Job 21:15 , etc.; Imperative masculine singular פְּגַע Judg 8:21 +; masculine plural פִּגְעוּ Gen 23:8 Infinitive construct לִפְגֹּע 1Sam 22:17 , suffix פִּגְעוֺ Num 35:19 ; Num 35:21 — 1. meet, light upon , with accusative of person 1Sam 10:5 ; Exod 5:20 ( J ), with suffix person Amos 5:19 שׁוֺר ׳ פ Exod 23:4 with ב person Gen 32:2 ( E ), Num 35:19 ; Num 35:21 ( P ); with ב location Gen 28:11 ( E ). 2. meet , with kindness, with accusative of person Isa 64:5 (subject ׳ י ), so Isa 47:3 according to Ew De Di and others; Che Hpt אֶפְרַע (reading, with Du , אמר for אָדָם ). 3. encounter with hostility, fall upon with ב person Josh 2:16 ( J E ), Judg 8:21 ; Judg 15:12 ; Judg 18:25 ; 1Sam 22:17 ; 1Sam 22:18 (twice in verse); 2Sam 1:15 ; 1Kgs 2:25 ; 1Kgs 2:29 ; 1Kgs 2:31 ; 1Kgs 2:32 ; 1Kgs 2:34 ; 1Kgs 2:46 ; Ruth 2:22 of God, with accusative (suffix), + ב instrumental Exod 5:3 . 4. encounter with request, entreat , with ב person Jer 7:16 ; Job 21:15 , followed by clause Jer 27:18 ; Ruth 1:16 , + ל person on whose behalf Gen 23:8 5. strike, touch , of boundary, with ב location Josh 16:7 ; Josh 19:11 ; Josh 19:22 ; Josh 19:26 ; Josh 19:27 ; Josh 19:34 (twice in verse), compare Josh 17:10 with אֶל location Josh 19:11 . Hiph`il 1. cause to light upon, Perfect 3 masculine singular הִפְגִּיעַ with accusative of thing + ב person Isa 53:6 . 2. cause one (accusative) to entreat 1 singular הִפְגַּעְתִּי ( ב person) Jer 15:11 (otherwise Gie ; Co strike out see as gloss). 3. make entreaty , 3 plural הִפְגִּעוּ Jer 36:25 with ב person; more generally interpose , Imperfect 3 masculine singular יַפְגִּיעַ Isa 53:12 , with ל person in whose behalf; Participle מַפְגִּיעַ Isa 59:16 one interposing . 4. make attack , only Participle Job 36:32 assailant , but Ol Bu Du and others מִפְגָּע mark .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6517')\">BDB6517</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6293')\">H6293</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6516')\">BDB6516</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6518')\">BDB6518</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>פָּגַע</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>meet, encounter, reach</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>פְּגַע</bdbarc>, <placeholder4162/>; possibly akin to Arabic <placeholder4163/>, <placeholder4164/> <highlight>happen to, light upon</highlight>; <placeholder4165/> is <highlight>pain, afflict</highlight>); — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 2:32\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(11,2,32)\">1Kgs 2:32</ref> +, suffix <bdbheb>וּפְגָעוֺ</bdbheb> consecutive <ref ref=\"Amos 5:19\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,19)\">Amos 5:19</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbheb>וַיִּפְגַּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 28:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,11)\">Gen 28:11</ref>+; 1 plural <bdbheb>נְפְגַּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 21:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,21,15)\">Job 21:15</ref>, etc.; <highlight>Imperative</highlight> masculine singular <bdbheb>פְּגַע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 8:21\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(7,8,21)\">Judg 8:21</ref>+; masculine plural <bdbheb>פִּגְעוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 23:8\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(1,23,8)\">Gen 23:8</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>לִפְגֹּע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 22:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,22,17)\">1Sam 22:17</ref>, suffix <bdbheb>פִּגְעוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 35:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,19)\">Num 35:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 35:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,21)\">Num 35:21</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>meet, light upon</highlight>, with accusative of person <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,5)\">1Sam 10:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 5:20\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(2,5,20)\">Exod 5:20</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), with suffix person <ref ref=\"Amos 5:19\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(30,5,19)\">Amos 5:19</ref> <bdbheb>שׁוֺר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 23:4\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,4)\">Exod 23:4</ref> with <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> person <ref ref=\"Gen 32:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,32,2)\">Gen 32:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Num 35:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,19)\">Num 35:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 35:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,35,21)\">Num 35:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); with <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb> location <ref ref=\"Gen 28:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,28,11)\">Gen 28:11</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"